# This file began as an auto-generated MPLAB script in the Harmony3 repository
# of example applications. It is part of a complex maze of makefiles and control
# variables in which the final makefile contains hundreds of literal insertions
# of directory paths, so that no change of control variable can re-configure the
# make for another platform. This maze is auto-generated by MPLAB, but we will
# not be using MPLAB, so our ultimate plan is to combine all the makefiles into
# one and to permit the makefile to be re-configured by single control variable
# changes.
#
# Kevan Hashemi, Open Source Instruments Inc., 2025.
#


